  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><h2 class=\"graf graf--p\">Steps to generate Barcode in the Print</h2><p class=\"graf graf--p\">Download <a class=\"markup--anchor markup--p-anchor\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/jsbarcode/3.5.1/JsBarcode.all.min.js\">JsBarcode.all.min.js</a>&nbsp;and include in the html script tag</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"c396de77-c4f5-4807-b5f2-d2991cb2f98e\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[<script src=\"{{path}}/JsBarcode.all.min.js\"></script>]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"note\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"33db772c-0401-4d88-89ec-1c456276a2c6\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>path = the path of the downloaded file (JSBarcode.all.min.js). One can choose different files from <a href=\"https://github.com/lindell/JsBarcode\">https://github.com/lindell/JsBarcode</a> depending on the configurations</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p>Create an image tag with parameter&nbsp;<em class=\"markup--em markup--p-em\">jsbarcode-value&nbsp;</em>which holds the value that can be used to generate the barcode.&nbsp;</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"91aa21f7-a2cc-490e-9cd4-0ead70e1df9e\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[<img id=\"barcode\"\n  jsbarcode-value=\"{{patient.primaryIdentifier.identifier}}\"\n</img>]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"c5fa3f37-b4c2-4cc3-863a-53c0cfc1d6c2\"><ac:rich-text-body><p><span>In above code snippet,</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"> <em><strong>patient.primaryIdentifier.identifier</strong></em>&nbsp;will hold the identifier of the patient. This identifier which is alphanumeric (most cases) is used to generate the barcode.</span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"note\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"fcb11b07-77a7-4161-912b-8a1ba6b73e73\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>One can choose to give different configurations for the size of the barcode and the position etc. Please refer <a href=\"https://github.com/lindell/JsBarcode/wiki/Options\">https://github.com/lindell/JsBarcode/wiki/Options</a><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p class=\"graf graf--p\">Initialize the barcode generation by adding &nbsp;below mentioned script tag</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"d73a0208-e500-41d6-ae26-6555bcbdb88b\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[<script>\n  (function() {  \n     JsBarcode(\"#barcode\").init();    \n  })();\n</script>]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"bb2bc5b8-ddc6-4303-8e52-369870cb28f7\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>Sample <a href=\"https://github.com/Bahmni/default-config/blob/4607f26326808c6a3342f8b4446dc1c6f88dcc17/openmrs/apps/registration/registrationCardLayout/printWithBarcode.html\">html page</a> with the above mentioned configurations</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p><ac:image ac:title=\"Sample Print Card with Barcode\" ac:alt=\"Sample Print Card with Barcode\" ac:height=\"250\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screen Shot 2016-10-10 at 12.14.41 pm.png\" /></ac:image></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"warning\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"842cac28-5636-4d1c-b6e9-1d7c41411bfe\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>This is not for Printing on Registration ID card. This works for normal printer.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"8d1838dd-8b02-4368-9f72-1b4003b91e42\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Related Links</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Configure Patient Card Prints\" /></ac:link></p><p><a href=\"https://medium.com/bahmni-blog/using-barcodes-in-bahmni-9c6eab83c760#.citawd6zd\">Blog on Using Barcodes in Bahmni</a></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
